     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"6 \\times {10^2} + 2 \\times {10^1} + 1 \\times {10^0}\"></span></p>\n<p>Remember that any base raised to the exponent 0 is 1.</p>\n<p>Use the order of expressions (PEMDAS), which means</p>\n<p>do the exponents first,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6 \\times 100 + 2 \\times 10 + 1 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p>then multiplications,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"600 + 20 + 1\"></span></p>\n<p>then additions.</p>\n<p>621</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "621"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
