    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"3 \\times {10^3} + 2 \\times {10^2} + 0 \\times {10^1} + 3 \\times {10^0}\"></span></p>\n<p>Remember that any base raised to the exponent 0 is 1.</p>\n<p>Use the order of expressions (PEMDAS), which means</p>\n<p>do the exponents first,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"3 \\times 1,000 + 2 \\times 100 + 0 \\times 10 + 3 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p>then multiplications,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"3,000 + 200 + 0 + 3\"></span></p>\n<p>then additions.</p>\n<p>3,203</p>"
